msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Uwekaji ufunguo / KWallet Fungua Kiotomatiki"

#: src/main.glade:440
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Washa uthibitishaji wa uso ili kufungua kiotomatiki ufunguo wako wa ku"
"ingia au KWallet unapoingia. Hii huhifadhi nenosiri lako lililofungwa "
"katika TPM linapopatikana, au limesimbwa kwa njia fiche kwa AES-256-GC"
"M kwa kutumia ufunguo mkuu wa mzizi pekee. Seti za uthibitishaji wa us"
"o PAM_AUTHTOK kwa pam_gnome_keyring au pam_kwallet5 kulingana na eneo-"
"kazi lako."

#: src/main.glade:471
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Hali ya Sasa:"

#: src/main.glade:486
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "Inaangalia..."

